@prefix cul: <https://recipes.example/culinary#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<vault://data/Baguette> a <https://recipes.example/culinary#Ingredient> .
<vault://data/Baguette> rdfs:comment "Day-old works best." .
<vault://data/Basil> a <https://recipes.example/culinary#Ingredient> .
<vault://data/Basil> rdfs:comment "Tear it, never chop it." .
<vault://data/Eggplant> a <https://recipes.example/culinary#Ingredient> .
<vault://data/Eggplant> rdfs:comment "Do not skip the salting." .
<vault://data/Garlic> a <https://recipes.example/culinary#Ingredient> .
<vault://data/Garlic> rdfs:comment "The backbone of everything." .
<vault://data/Garlic%20Bread> a <https://recipes.example/culinary#Recipe> .
