<vault://data/Garlic%20Bread> cul:hasIngredient <vault://data/Garlic> .
<vault://data/Garlic%20Bread> cul:hasIngredient <vault://data/Olive%20Oil> .
<vault://data/Garlic%20Bread> cul:prepTime 12 .
<vault://data/Garlic%20Bread> cul:title "Golden Garlic Bread" .
<vault://data/Olive%20Oil> a <https://recipes.example/culinary#Ingredient> .
<vault://data/Olive%20Oil> rdfs:comment "Use the good bottle." .
